  "engineering-wiki": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "content": "<h1>Deploy to Production 🚀</h1>",
        "id": "#5",
        "index": 0,
        "page_id": "#2",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading1",
      },
      {
        "content": "<details open=""><summary>⚠️ Before you start</summary><div data-details-content=""><p>CI is green on <code>main</code> and the deploy window is announced in the team channel.</p></div></details>",
        "id": "#6",
        "index": 1,
        "page_id": "#2",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "callout",
      },
      {
        "content": "<h2>Steps</h2>",
        "id": "#7",
        "index": 2,
        "page_id": "#2",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading2",
      },
      {
        "content": "<ol><li>Merge to <code>main</code> and wait for CI to pass</li><li>Tag the release: <code>git tag vX.Y.Z</code></li><li>Run <code>npm run deploy:prod</code></li><li>Verify health checks and smoke-test the live site</li><li>Announce the deploy in the team channel</li></ol>",
        "id": "#8",
        "index": 3,
        "page_id": "#2",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "numberedList",
      },
      {
        "content": "<details open=""><summary>↩️ Rollback</summary><div data-details-content=""><p>Re-deploy the previous tag: <code>npm run deploy:prod -- --tag vX.Y.(Z-1)</code></p></div></details>",
        "id": "#9",
        "index": 4,
        "page_id": "#2",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "callout",
      },
      {
        "content": "<h1>Incident Response 🚨</h1>",
        "id": "#10",
        "index": 0,
        "page_id": "#3",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading1",
      },
      {
        "content": "<details open=""><summary>🔴 Severity</summary><div data-details-content=""><p>SEV1 = full outage · SEV2 = major degradation · SEV3 = minor / workaround exists.</p></div></details>",
        "id": "#11",
        "index": 1,
        "page_id": "#3",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "callout",
      },
      {
        "content": "<h2>Playbook</h2>",
        "id": "#12",
        "index": 2,
        "page_id": "#3",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading2",
      },
      {
        "content": "<ol><li>Acknowledge — claim the incident so there's a single owner</li><li>Assess — scope the impact and assign a severity</li><li>Mitigate — stop the bleeding (roll back, disable, scale)</li><li>Communicate — post status updates on a fixed cadence</li><li>Resolve & write a blameless postmortem</li></ol>",
        "id": "#13",
        "index": 3,
        "page_id": "#3",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "numberedList",
      },
      {
        "content": "<h1>Runbooks 📕</h1>",
        "id": "#14",
        "index": 0,
        "page_id": "#1",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading1",
      },
      {
        "content": "<p>Step-by-step operational procedures. Open one below, or add your own as a new sub-page of this one.</p>",
        "id": "#15",
        "index": 1,
        "page_id": "#1",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "paragraph",
      },
      {
        "content": "<h2>Procedures</h2>",
        "id": "#16",
        "index": 2,
        "page_id": "#1",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading2",
      },
      {
        "content": "#2",
        "id": "#17",
        "index": 3,
        "page_id": "#1",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "pageLink",
      },
      {
        "content": "#3",
        "id": "#18",
        "index": 4,
        "page_id": "#1",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "pageLink",
      },
      {
        "content": "<h1>Onboarding Guide 🧭</h1>",
        "id": "#19",
        "index": 0,
        "page_id": "#4",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading1",
      },
      {
        "content": "<p>Welcome aboard! Work through this during your first week.</p>",
        "id": "#20",
        "index": 1,
        "page_id": "#4",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "paragraph",
      },
      {
        "content": "<h2>First-week checklist</h2>",
        "id": "#21",
        "index": 2,
        "page_id": "#4",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading2",
      },
      {
        "content": "<ul class="task-list"><li data-checked="false">Get access to the repo, CI, and the team channel</li></ul>",
        "id": "#22",
        "index": 3,
        "page_id": "#4",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "todo",
      },
      {
        "content": "<ul class="task-list"><li data-checked="false">Set up your local environment (see Getting Started)</li></ul>",
        "id": "#23",
        "index": 4,
        "page_id": "#4",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "todo",
      },
      {
        "content": "<ul class="task-list"><li data-checked="false">Read the Architecture section and the Runbooks</li></ul>",
        "id": "#24",
        "index": 5,
        "page_id": "#4",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "todo",
      },
      {
        "content": "<ul class="task-list"><li data-checked="false">Ship a small PR to learn the workflow</li></ul>",
        "id": "#25",
        "index": 6,
        "page_id": "#4",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "todo",
      },
      {
        "content": "<ul class="task-list"><li data-checked="false">Pair with a teammate on a real task</li></ul>",
        "id": "#26",
        "index": 7,
        "page_id": "#4",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "todo",
      },
      {
        "content": "<details open=""><summary>🔗 Handy links</summary><div data-details-content=""><ul><li>Repo & PR guidelines</li><li>Design system / component library</li><li>On-call schedule</li></ul></div></details>",
        "id": "#27",
        "index": 8,
        "page_id": "#4",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "toggle",
      },
      {
        "content": "<h1>Engineering Wiki 📚</h1>",
        "id": "#28",
        "index": 0,
        "page_id": "#0",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading1",
      },
      {
        "content": "<p>Your team's home base for docs, decisions, and how-tos. Expand a section to read it, collapse it to scan. Deeper guides live as their own sub-pages.</p>",
        "id": "#29",
        "index": 1,
        "page_id": "#0",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "paragraph",
      },
      {
        "content": "<details open=""><summary>🚀 Getting Started</summary><div data-details-content=""><p>Get a local environment running:</p><ul><li>Clone: <code>git clone &lt;repo-url&gt;</code></li><li>Install: <code>npm install</code></li><li>Start: <code>npm run dev</code></li></ul></div></details>",
        "id": "#30",
        "index": 2,
        "page_id": "#0",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "toggle",
      },
      {
        "content": "<details open=""><summary>🏗️ Architecture</summary><div data-details-content=""><p>How the pieces fit together:</p><ul><li><strong>Frontend</strong> (React) — the editor and UI</li><li><strong>API server</strong> (Node/Effect) — business logic and auth</li><li><strong>SQLite</strong> — single-file storage you control</li></ul></div></details>",
        "id": "#31",
        "index": 3,
        "page_id": "#0",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "toggle",
      },
      {
        "content": "<details open=""><summary>📐 Standards & Conventions</summary><div data-details-content=""><ul><li>Code style: ESLint + Prettier (<code>npm run lint</code> before committing)</li><li>Git: feature branches → PR → squash merge into <code>main</code></li><li>Tests: unit for business logic, integration for APIs</li></ul></div></details>",
        "id": "#32",
        "index": 4,
        "page_id": "#0",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "toggle",
      },
      {
        "content": "<h2>📂 Sub-pages</h2>",
        "id": "#33",
        "index": 5,
        "page_id": "#0",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading2",
      },
      {
        "content": "<p>Deeper docs live as their own pages. Click in below, or browse the nested tree in the sidebar — sub-pages can nest as deep as you like.</p>",
