  "project-tracker": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "content": "<h1>Project Brief 📋</h1>",
        "id": "#2",
        "index": 0,
        "page_id": "#1",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading1",
      },
      {
        "content": "<h2>Goal</h2>",
        "id": "#3",
        "index": 1,
        "page_id": "#1",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading2",
      },
      {
        "content": "<p>What are we building and why? Capture the problem and the outcome that defines success.</p>",
        "id": "#4",
        "index": 2,
        "page_id": "#1",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "paragraph",
      },
      {
        "content": "<h2>Scope</h2>",
        "id": "#5",
        "index": 3,
        "page_id": "#1",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading2",
      },
      {
        "content": "<ul><li>In scope: …</li><li>Out of scope: …</li></ul>",
        "id": "#6",
        "index": 4,
        "page_id": "#1",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "bulletList",
      },
      {
        "content": "<h2>Milestones</h2>",
        "id": "#7",
        "index": 5,
        "page_id": "#1",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading2",
      },
      {
        "content": "<ol><li>Kickoff & scope locked</li><li>MVP feature-complete</li><li>Beta with first users</li><li>v1.0 launch</li></ol>",
        "id": "#8",
        "index": 6,
        "page_id": "#1",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "numberedList",
      },
      {
        "content": "<h2>Stakeholders</h2>",
        "id": "#9",
        "index": 7,
        "page_id": "#1",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading2",
      },
      {
        "content": "<ul><li>Product: …</li><li>Engineering: …</li><li>Design: …</li></ul>",
        "id": "#10",
        "index": 8,
        "page_id": "#1",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "bulletList",
      },
      {
        "content": "<h1>Project Tracker 🗂️</h1>",
        "id": "#11",
        "index": 0,
        "page_id": "#0",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading1",
      },
      {
        "content": "<p>Track tasks, assign owners, and manage your sprint. Switch to the <strong>Board</strong> view for a Kanban layout.</p>",
        "id": "#12",
        "index": 1,
        "page_id": "#0",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "paragraph",
      },
      {
        "content": "<h2>📂 Project docs</h2>",
        "id": "#13",
        "index": 2,
        "page_id": "#0",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading2",
      },
      {
        "content": "<p>Supporting docs live as sub-pages so the tracker stays focused on tasks:</p>",
        "id": "#14",
        "index": 3,
        "page_id": "#0",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "paragraph",
      },
      {
        "content": "#1",
        "id": "#15",
        "index": 4,
        "page_id": "#0",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "pageLink",
      },
      {
        "content": "",
        "id": "#16",
        "index": 5,
        "page_id": "#0",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "divider",
      },
      {
        "content": "<h2>Sprints</h2>",
        "id": "#17",
        "index": 6,
        "page_id": "#0",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading2",
      },
      {
        "content": "<p>Group work into sprints. Tasks link here via a <strong>relation</strong>.</p>",
        "id": "#18",
        "index": 7,
        "page_id": "#0",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "paragraph",
      },
      {
        "content": "<h2>Tasks</h2>",
        "id": "#19",
        "index": 8,
        "page_id": "#0",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading2",
      },
      {
        "content": "<p>Each task links to its <strong>Sprint</strong> (a relation to the database above) and can point to a <strong>Spec</strong> page.</p>",
        "id": "#20",
        "index": 9,
        "page_id": "#0",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "paragraph",
      },
    ],
