  "reading-list": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "content": "<h1>Notes: Atomic Habits 📝</h1>",
        "id": "#3",
        "index": 0,
        "page_id": "#1",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading1",
      },
      {
        "content": "<h2>Key ideas</h2>",
        "id": "#4",
        "index": 1,
        "page_id": "#1",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading2",
      },
      {
        "content": "<ul><li>Small habits compound: 1% better every day</li><li>Focus on systems, not goals</li><li>Make it obvious, attractive, easy, satisfying</li></ul>",
        "id": "#5",
        "index": 2,
        "page_id": "#1",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "bulletList",
      },
      {
        "content": "<h2>What I'll try</h2>",
        "id": "#6",
        "index": 3,
        "page_id": "#1",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading2",
      },
      {
        "content": "<ul class="task-list"><li data-checked="false">Stack a 5-minute walk after morning coffee</li></ul>",
        "id": "#7",
        "index": 4,
        "page_id": "#1",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "todo",
      },
      {
        "content": "<h1>Notes: The Pragmatic Programmer 📝</h1>",
        "id": "#8",
        "index": 0,
        "page_id": "#2",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading1",
      },
      {
        "content": "<h2>Highlights</h2>",
        "id": "#9",
        "index": 1,
        "page_id": "#2",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading2",
      },
      {
        "content": "<ul><li>Don't repeat yourself</li><li>Fix broken windows early</li><li>Tracer bullets beat big up-front design</li></ul>",
        "id": "#10",
        "index": 2,
        "page_id": "#2",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "bulletList",
      },
      {
        "content": "<h1>Reading List 📖</h1>",
        "id": "#11",
        "index": 0,
        "page_id": "#0",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "heading1",
      },
      {
        "content": "<p>Track what you want to read, what you're reading, and what you thought. Each book links to a notes page.</p>",
        "id": "#12",
        "index": 1,
        "page_id": "#0",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "paragraph",
      },
    ],
